  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Cotton &amp; Textile Industries Federation (ACTIF) og Danske Mode</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Fashion and Textile, (DFT) and African Cotton and Textile Industries Federation (ACTIF) in cooperation with its national member Kenya Association of Manufacturers (KAM), Danish Federation of SME&#xbf;s (DFSME) and Thygesen Fabrics (TF) investigated the possibility for initiating a project which shall improve the Kenyan textile and garment value chain. The idea is to facilitate such a process by removing bottlenecks and establish missing links in order to pave the way for long term partnerships between a broad range of Danish and Kenyan garment and textile companies.</narrative>
  </description>
